# Copy to .env (gitignored). tools/ship.sh loads it to pull the newest exam banks from the brain through the bank hatch
# (tools/brain_banks.py: GitLab API, bank files only, no clone). Used only when no local brain clone is found.
# GitLab → brain project → Settings → Access tokens: role Reporter, scope read_api, expiry 30-90 days.
BRAIN_TOKEN=
# Optional: path to an existing brain clone (default ~/brain, then /home/claude/brain); a clone wins over the hatch.
# BRAIN_DIR=
# Optional overrides: BRAIN_API (default https://gitlab.com/api/v4), BRAIN_PROJECT (default Forzalab-bravo/brain), BRAIN_REF (main).
